        "\n"
        "Github URL:  %1\n"
        "Source REPO: %2\n"
        "\n"
        "Default: \"main\" (latest development version)\n"
        "Examples: \"main\", \"v1.12\", \"v1.11\"\n"
        "\n"
        "The current plugin will be backed up and replaced. The configuration.lua will be preserved."
msgstr  "Iontráil ainm brainse nó clib chun breiseán an Chúntóra AI a nuashonrú ón stór foinseach.\n"
        "\n"
        "URL Github:  %1\n"
        "REPO Foinse: %2\n"
        "\n"
        "Réamhshocrú: \"main\" (an leagan forbartha is déanaí)\n"
        "Samplaí: \"main\", \"v1.12\", \"v1.11\"\n"
        "\n"
        "Déanfar cúltaca den bhreiseán reatha agus cuirfear ceann nua ina áit. Caomhnófar an comhad configuration.lua."

