#: ../main.lua:681
msgid   "Usage Tips\n"
        "\n"
        "Select:\n"
        "Highlight text (or a word) in the book, then press [AI assistant] in the poped up menu.\n"
        "\n"
        "Long Press:\n"
        "- On a Prompt Button: Add to the highlight menu.\n"
        "- On a highlight menu button to remove it.\n"
        "- On the Close button to go back to the book in 1 step.\n"
        "\n"
        "Very-Long Press (over 3 seconds):\n"
        "On a single word in the book to show the highlight menu (instead of the dictionary).\n"
        "\n"
        "Multi-Swipe (e.g., ⮠, ⮡, ↺):\n"
        "On the result dialog to close (as the Close button is far to reach).\n"
msgstr  "Leideanna Úsáide\n"
        "\n"
        "Roghnaigh:\n"
        "Aibhsigh téacs (nó focal) sa leabhar, ansin brúigh [cúntóir AI] sa roghchlár a thagann aníos.\n"
        "\n"
        "Brú Fada:\n"
        "- Ar Chnaipe Leid: Cuir leis an roghchlár aibhsithe.\n"
        "- Ar chnaipe roghchláir aibhsithe chun é a bhaint.\n"
        "- Ar an gCnaipe Dún chun filleadh ar an leabhar i gcéim amháin.\n"
        "\n"
        "Brú An-Fhada (thar 3 soicind):\n"
        "Ar fhocal amháin sa leabhar chun an roghchlár aibhsithe a thaispeáint (in ionad an fhoclóra).\n"
        "\n"
        "Il-Sciobadh (m.sh., ⮠, ⮡, ↺):\n"
        "Ar an dialóg toraidh le dúnadh (toisc go bhfuil an Cnaipe Dún i bhfad le baint amach).\n"

